{"917950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vellum", "steam_appid": 917950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/37bb475c9c112d4878cb45bfca8aa354.poster.avif?t=1780616152\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/37bb475c9c112d4878cb45bfca8aa354.webm?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/37bb475c9c112d4878cb45bfca8aa354.mp4?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WRITE IDEA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vellum </strong>is a co-op, literary roguelike; harness the class-defining colors, master an inspired spellbook, and influence the growth of your enemy - your imagination is key to saving the books!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with pen-pals or dive solo into each mechanically-unique Tome where every page is another step toward rule-breaking power!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip your quills in quick, dynamic adventures full of synergy, discovery, and the ultimate power fantasy!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/39b0dfff40da345f74face8092c23277.poster.avif?t=1780616152\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/39b0dfff40da345f74face8092c23277.webm?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/39b0dfff40da345f74face8092c23277.mp4?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE YOUR SPELL-ING... WITH COLOR!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield colorful, class-defining <strong>Signature Inks</strong>  - feed your health with vampiric <i>Red</i>, blot out enemies with endless waves of <i>Blue</i>, command your Inkling pet with <i>Green</i>, and discover the strengths of <i>Pink</i>, <i>Yellow</i>, <i>Teal</i>, and <i>Orange</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/0b0a99d5ee315d93073e9361cf1754fa.avif?t=1780616152\" width=700 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Author your own playstyle</strong> by mixing together a wide roster of ink-fueled <strong>Spells</strong>; warp in <i>Planets</i> to control an area, lunge forward with sharp <i>Swords</i>, clobber distant foes with <i>Dice</i>, toss splash-heavy <i>Potions</i>, summon inky <i>Flowers</i>, <i>Lanterns</i>, <i>Shields</i>, <i>Anvils</i>, <i>Ravens</i>, and many more heavy-handed metaphors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color infuses each Spell from the start - in these books, your creative builds and revolutionary ideas will reach untold heights; <strong>Pages of Power</strong> constantly offer fresh ways to discover, combine, and master the world-making mysteries of ink. Imagination is your superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.poster.avif?t=1780616152\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.webm?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.mp4?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE TOMES FROM THE TEAR-ABLE TORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive deep into the myriad <strong>Tomes</strong>: echoes of familiar tales and fables with unique, run-altering mechanics. Band together with your fellow players to harness thematic, team-wide boons in your fight to preserve these pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot twist - <strong>The Torn </strong>hunger for pages of their own! Play to your strengths by <strong>choosing how your foes evolve</strong>. Save more books from this dynamic foe, apply higher <strong>Binding Challenges</strong> to each journey, and overcome even the toughest obstacles to protect the Illuminated Library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.poster.avif?t=1780616152\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.webm?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.mp4?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOME: FREE TO BE YOUR SHELF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home, sweet home! Rest and regroup in <strong>The Illuminated Library</strong> between adventures. Refine your strengths by researching and enhancing the power of your Ink! There's always a cozy place to read - especially when you can <strong>make one</strong> yourself! Explore the Library's secrets, then relax in your personal <strong>Customizable Reading Nook</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.poster.avif?t=1780616152\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.webm?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.mp4?t=1780616152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RAID BETWEEN THE LINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deeper evil lies in store,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beyond the page and secret door,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A broken realm where magic fades</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware the dreaded <strong>Torn Lord Raids...</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/c5ef6e9d956c69aaac45025e6d464886.webp?t=1780616152\" width=700 height=44 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Table of Contents:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swift Tales</strong>: Approachable, under 30-minute roguelike runs crafted for quick gameplay sessions for 1-4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Inks</strong>: Infuse your spells with one of <i>6 colorful classes</i>, complete with their own unique upgrades and rewarding challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls of Power</strong>: Tear through enemies with over 300 powers for you and your team. All powers can be build-makers, no filler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shaping Your Spellbook</strong>: Wield and combine an imaginative roster of over 20 spells - conjure Sewing Needles, hurl Anchors, sling Playing Cards - then enhance them with limit-breaking augments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torn Pages</strong>: With over 100 enemy upgrades and effects to choose from, only you will decide how your foes evolve throughout the course of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal Reading Nooks</strong>: Show off your style with hundreds of decorations in your customizable corner of the Library!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Font</strong>: Invoke unique <strong>Tome</strong>-themed powers as a team in combination with your individual builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talented Research</strong>: Enhance the magic of ink between runs to improve your Scribe with customizable talents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Bindings</strong>: Increase your challenge by affixing bindings to your runs. Greater danger brings greater rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotating Book Club</strong>: Join other Scribes in tackling fresh, global challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Raid Realms: </strong>Face the Splice Lord in The Forgery and confront the Raving Lord in The Grey Area!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reference Section</strong>: All the high quality literature puns you could ever desire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Appendices</strong>: Reached the end? Found the perfect build? Face the Appendices and continue the fight!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_t